{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t石鼓洲旁人工島綜合廢物管理設施第1期下午發生的三級火，火勢於下午3時許受到包圍。火警中一人不適，約930人自行疏散到安全地方。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n火警發生下午12時許，警方接獲職員報案，消防於下午1時24分將火警升為三級，火警中一人懷疑吸入濃煙不適，送往東區醫院治理。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李俊傑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:00:45.291062+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:33:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:33.555180+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:58:25.474150+00:00","content_hash":"d63df2bac3893f0a5b9444d40872de56d98a2e881de19c08a2ebb50a3a744155","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}